From 0332263b2b3a88a1e2cc7a5d1d0c884555c009db Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Iori Yanokura <ab.ioryz@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 14:51:37 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] hw/char: Add Renesas RA Serial Communications Interface
 (SCI)

Model the SCI in asynchronous (UART) mode, without FIFO, as used by the
FSP r_sci_uart driver. Transmission is interrupt driven through the TXI
and TEI events; the Arduino core spins until the TX-empty callback, so
these events must be generated exactly as the FSP expects. Reception
raises RXI.
